// WearWhat 今天穿什么 · 数据模型
// SQLite 方言（本地 dev 用 SQLite，生产部署 Cloudflare D1 —— 同为 SQLite 方言，可 1:1 迁移）

generator client {
  provider     = "prisma-client"
  output       = "../src/generated/prisma-worker-pg"
  runtime      = "workerd"
  moduleFormat = "esm"
}

datasource db {
  provider = "postgresql"
  url      = env("DATABASE_URL")
  schemas  = ["wearwhat"]
}

// 用户（邮箱注册）
model User {
  id           String   @id @default(cuid())
  email        String   @unique
  // bcrypt 哈希
  passwordHash String
  name         String?
  createdAt    DateTime @default(now())
  updatedAt    DateTime @updatedAt

  @@schema("wearwhat")
}

// 邮箱验证码（注册 / 找回密码）
model VerificationCode {
  id        String   @id @default(cuid())
  email     String
  code      String
  // register / reset
  type      String
  expiresAt DateTime
  used      Boolean  @default(false)
  createdAt DateTime @default(now())

  @@index([email, type])

  @@schema("wearwhat")
}

// 衣物单品
model ClothingItem {
  id              String    @id @default(cuid())
  userId          String    @default("default")
  name            String?
  // 类别: top / pants / skirt / outer / shoes / bag / accessory
  category        String
  color           String?
  // 图案: solid / striped / plaid / print
  pattern         String?
  material        String?
  // 季节 JSON 数组字符串: ["spring","autumn"] 或 ["all"]
  seasons         String    @default("[]")
  // 场合 JSON 数组字符串: ["commute","casual","sport","date","formal","home"]
  occasions       String    @default("[]")
  brand           String?
  size            String?
  price           Float?
  purchaseDate    DateTime?
  // 收纳状态: wearing / stored / laundry / repair / discarded
  storageStatus   String    @default("wearing")
  storageLocation String?
  wearCount       Int       @default(0)
  lastWornAt      DateTime?
  // 图片：base64 data URL 或静态资源路径
  imageData       String?
  notes           String?
  createdAt       DateTime  @default(now())
  updatedAt       DateTime  @updatedAt

  outfitItems OutfitItem[]

  @@schema("wearwhat")
}

// 穿搭记录（一天可以有多条）
model Outfit {
  id        String   @id @default(cuid())
  userId    String   @default("default")
  // 日期字符串 YYYY-MM-DD（D1/SQLite 友好，避免时区问题）
  date      String
  occasion  String?
  // 天气快照 JSON 字符串
  weather   String?
  notes     String?
  // 来源: manual / recommend
  source    String   @default("manual")
  createdAt DateTime @default(now())

  items OutfitItem[]

  @@index([userId, date])

  @@schema("wearwhat")
}

// 穿搭 <-> 衣物 关联
model OutfitItem {
  outfitId       String
  clothingItemId String

  outfit   Outfit       @relation(fields: [outfitId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  clothing ClothingItem @relation(fields: [clothingItemId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)

  @@id([outfitId, clothingItemId])

  @@schema("wearwhat")
}

// 愿望清单
model WishlistItem {
  id            String   @id @default(cuid())
  userId        String   @default("default")
  name          String
  category      String?
  expectedPrice Float?
  priority      Int      @default(0)
  notes         String?
  createdAt     DateTime @default(now())

  @@schema("wearwhat")
}
